        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="text_32" value="&lt;div&gt;Order 1–0..1 Payment and Order 1–0..1 Delivery are SQL maxima; successful checkout / markReady supplies required rows.&lt;br/&gt;Payment.amount is COD due or captured ONLINE amount C; refund_amount is owed, not paid. All event timestamps are UTC.&lt;br/&gt;Payment.updated_at is SQL NOT NULL; PaymentDAO.insert uses updated_at or created_at (P2-S08), so this is not a gap.&lt;br/&gt;FAILED / REFUNDED remain SQL/enum values but are deferred or unreachable per P2-S01; no payout is drawn.&lt;br/&gt;Continuation: Order resolves to PartC; UserAccount resolves to PartA; replacement offers continue in PartE.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=26;fontColor=#202B36;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="82" y="942" width="1465.6875" height="162.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
